'''Crystal Shard''' is a niche [[Spells|spell]] that creates several crystal shards.

==Description==
Crystal shard contains a central crystal sigil surrounded by inverted column keystones. It causes causes several large, shard-like crystals to suddenly erupt from the glyph.{{Ref|m|18|12}}

==Usage==
[[Riche]] once used the spell during the height of an emotional outburst which occurred as a result of [[Qifrey]] suggesting she study magic other than her own.{{Ref|m|18|12}}

